# No secrets committed.
#
# Reserved provider names. Nothing in this repository reads either one today: the
# CLI is free and BYO-AI, no verb opens a socket or reads a credential, and the
# Model Provider Port takes its adapter by injection rather than from the
# environment (docs/runnable-surfaces.md, "Commercial model"). They are names held
# for a reviewed adapter, not configuration that currently has an effect.
# SCENEAXI_PROVIDER=
# SCENEAXI_API_KEY=

# --- deployable sites + identity/credits plane ---
# docs/websites-deploy.md owns the full site table; docs/auth-credits.md owns identity and credits.
# Names only, never values. Each site also ships its own .env.example.
# One shared Neon Postgres database for the identity plane and catalog read models; apply db/migrations in order.
# DATABASE_URL=
# Exactly one captain email and its first-run bootstrap material, env-secret only.
# A plural SCENEAXI_ADMIN_EMAILS is refused on presence.
# SCENEAXI_ADMIN_EMAIL=
# SCENEAXI_ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_SECRET=
# Stripe TEST keys only; live mode needs a separate captain decision.
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# SCENEAXI_BILLING_MODE=
# Cross-surface origins, https *.vercel.app. Build-time values.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SCENEAXI_UMBRELLA_ORIGIN=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SCENEAXI_GAME_CATALOG_ORIGIN=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SCENEAXI_WEB_CATALOG_ORIGIN=
# Temporary, banner-marked editor fallback only; hosted sign-in at /login is the
# product path. See docs/websites-deploy.md for activation and removal.
# SCENEAXI_SITE_EDITOR_PREVIEW=
